"}, {"name": "IDENTITY.md", "rel": ".openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md", "path": "/workspace/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md", "bytes": 1278, "kind": "md", "content": "# IDENTITY.md - Who Am I?

_Fill this in during your first conversation. Make it yours._

- **Name:**
